{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56633","headline":"醉公子 · 无名氏","name":"醉公子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门外猧儿吠，知是萧郎至。\n剗袜下芳（《词品》作「香」）阶，冤家今夜醉。\n扶得入罗帏，不肯脱罗衣。\n醉则从他醉，犹胜独眠（《词品》作「睡」）时。\n（见宋陈模《怀古录》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}